83eea1bdeb8177d.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣ICYMI: We had a blast at the RVA Bike Awards! 🚲🎉 Eight gorgeous, hand-built trophies were awarded to the...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/db5ae8f2b39c4af3.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣ICYMI: We had a blast at the RVA Bike Awards! 🚲🎉 Eight gorgeous, hand-built trophies were awarded to the...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/3dace3cb7a509472.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;📣ICYMI: We had a blast at the RVA Bike Awards! 🚲🎉 Eight gorgeous, hand-built trophies were awarded to the...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/d9b4051c6ea55d72.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;📣ICYMI: We had a blast at the RVA Bike Awards! 🚲🎉 Eight gorgeous, hand-built trophies were awarded to the people and projects keeping Richmond’s bike community rolling, and the room was full of cheers for every one of them. AND there was bonus reason to celebrate - Brantley turned 40! 🎂🥳 To mark the occasion we added an extra freaky costume contest category in his honor, and you all brought your A-game. Thank you to everyone who came out, dressed up and celebrated with us. Happy birthday, Brantley, and congrats to all of this year’s honorees! 🏆 See uou in 2027 🙌🏽🙌🏿🙌🏼</content></entry>
